=== HINT 1 ===
typedef struct syntax (two common forms):

Form A (separate):
  struct Vec2 { double x; double y; };
  typedef struct Vec2 Vec2;

Form B (combined):
  typedef struct { double x; double y; } Vec2;

=== HINT 2 ===
vec2_add: return a new Vec2 where x = a.x+b.x, y = a.y+b.y
vec2_scale: return a new Vec2 where x = v.x*s, y = v.y*s

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
typedef struct { double x; double y; } Vec2;

Vec2 vec2_add(Vec2 a, Vec2 b) {
    return (Vec2){ a.x + b.x, a.y + b.y };
}
Vec2 vec2_scale(Vec2 v, double s) {
    return (Vec2){ v.x * s, v.y * s };
}
